WEBVTT

00:00:00.447 --> 00:00:01.709
Meet Finance Studio.

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:04.173
See where your money goes, on the web

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:05.496
and on your phone.

00:00:07.447 --> 00:00:09.680
Open Overview to see what came in, what

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.865
went out, and how much cash you have.

00:00:15.447 --> 00:00:17.619
Pick a currency right above the charts.

00:00:18.081 --> 00:00:20.969
Follow net wealth, income, and spending in that

00:00:20.981 --> 00:00:21.479
currency.

00:00:23.435 --> 00:00:25.449
On your phone, go to Entries to log

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.141
a purchase.

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.156
Use Filters to find it again.

00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:32.503
Have a spreadsheet already?

00:00:32.903 --> 00:00:34.712
Paste the rows on the web, review the

00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:36.132
batch, and save.

00:00:38.447 --> 00:00:39.090
Paid for the group?

00:00:39.479 --> 00:00:41.797
Open Claims to see what’s still owed and

00:00:41.809 --> 00:00:42.792
record each payment.

00:00:46.447 --> 00:00:47.952
Set money aside for a goal.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:53.401
In Invest, record contributions, withdrawals, and updated valuations.

00:00:55.447 --> 00:00:58.311
On the web, ask the assistant to prepare

00:00:58.457 --> 00:00:59.525
entries from a statement.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.503
Review the draft before you save.

00:01:04.435 --> 00:01:07.214
Keep personal and business records in separate sheets.

00:01:07.578 --> 00:01:10.636
Export one overview PDF with a section for

00:01:10.746 --> 00:01:11.474
each currency.

00:01:13.435 --> 00:01:14.782
Open the demo to explore.

00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:16.117
Finance Studio.
